  {X : ActualOps (JC.parLev P0 j).k (JC.parLev P0 j).r (T.bs j).z (T.bs j).z' (T.bs j).π (T.bs j).π'}
  {μ : MeasureTheory.Measure (Mt (JC.parLev P0 j).k (JC.parLev P0 j).r)}
